<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian forex mkt closed Monday.</title>
<headline>Australian forex mkt closed Monday.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian foreign exchange market is closed on Monday for the Easter holidays. Local trading will resume as normal on Tuesday.</p>
<p>On Thursday the Australian dollar was at US$0.7858/63 late in local trading, having proven more resilient than the market had expected on the day.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
